# Artifacts: ignore heavy training state/checkpoints (e.g. optimizer.pt 126 MB),
# keep tiny pure-text benchmark inputs (~630 KB) and LoRA B inference weights (63 MB)
/artifacts/*
!/artifacts/graph-synthetic-v2.1/
